## Environment Variables

Set these for easier testing:

```bash
export TARGET="https://target.com"
export API_KEY="your-api-key"
export AUTH_TOKEN="your-token"
```

Then use:
```bash
curl $TARGET/api
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $AUTH_TOKEN" $TARGET/api
```

